 the first  time I watched the opening of season one  it felt like an overwhelming bombardment  of stuff you know I  sentient green clouds and broccoli  nothing makes sense and I'm not sure how  much I care for it to make sense but I  am so so glad I stuck with it just that  a little bit longer because Mom cycle  100 is capable of producing some damn  fine drama in addition to comedy and  action which was very unexpected for me  going into it it's actually pretty  amazing just how much you come to care  for these characters and I mean pretty  much all of them by the end of the  series I'm not sure if there was a  single recurring character no matter how  minor that I didn't have some sort of  investment in which is a huge credit to  the original author for crafting such  captivating figures as well as to bones  for doing them justice in animated form  so with all of this said does mump  psycho 100 have issues or is it indeed a  perfect series as I've probably made it  sound then I'm not sure looking back on  it I don't have any major issues from  character's story or animation  perspectives but I also think the series  gets a lot of leeway because of how  absurdly it presents itself so any fall  of poor storytelling that may be a  burden on more how shall we say serious  anime is very much forgiven in mob cycle  100 because it starts you off on the  premise that this series is weird enough  for anything to happen making it very  difficult to nitpick I mean if I was to  be really hyper critical I might cite  pacing as a minor issue because both  seasons follow a rather simple model  stacking the slice-of-life episodes into  the first half and then going all out on  plot development in the second half and  that's not necessarily a bad thing I  just personally prefer plot to be  ever-present and always feel like we're  progressing towards something and there  was some episodes where I finished  watching and went so yeah that was fun  but I do wish I'd moved along a bit more  but that is me being super super  critical it really is such a small issue  and one that may even only be exclusive  to me which is why I have no  reservations whatsoever about  recommending mump psycho 100 to any and  everyone it's not a huge commitment  either because early consists of two  seasons 13 episodes apiece with one ova  and another OVA to come I believe very  very easily digestible in no time at all  the biggest total once again is going to  be getting over the art style if you're  not accustomed to unique aesthetics but  it is well worth it because visually  there's so much in this series that can  be done that simply cannot be achieved  in the series it follows a more standard  artistic direction and really I just  can't remember the last time I had so  much fun with a series while still being  so invested in its characters and  overall story Mobe psycho 100 ticks all  the boxes for me it was a very pleasant  surprise because I started watching it  on a whim because I wasn't ready to  commit to something more serious  just yet and so I found myself with a  real gem and a fantastic experience and  I have  no doubt that you will find yourself in  very much the same situation but that  pretty much does it for why you should  watch mom psycho 100 if you enjoyed this  video and the content this channel  produced in general then please do  consider donating to the New World  review patreon because the support of  all of your amazing people is what  continues to make this channel possible  and the patreon isn't quite yourself and  please do leave this video will like  share or subscribe because it also helps  support this channel an incredible  amount and if you'd like to join the fun  at any time then please do head over to  my discord server where a wide array of  shenanigan retakes place on a daily  basis and finally please do comment with  your thoughts on mob psycho 100 this has  been the new world review and I'll see  you next time  [Music]  who